"localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [71], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314.0000305175781], "pos": [-92.85029602050781, 108.27449798583984], "widgets_values": ["0723446d10caffb0f96a98e4b6ba36831926fb24142f40a25cf6399c138c02a0.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [72], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [204.63641357421875, 1275.9349365234375], "widgets_values": ["产品名称是", "，主色调和点缀色都不要出现抛光银这样的色，尺寸单位为in，点缀色和产品颜色有相似之处,"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "a"}, "name": "a", "link": 54, "label": "a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "a"}, {"widget": {"name": "b"}, "name": "b", "label": "b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "b"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "JWStringConcat", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JWStringConcat"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [288.25360107421875, 586.1123046875], "pos": [1250.1298828125, 856.8657836914062], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 74, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "JjkShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkShowText"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "slot_index": 0, "links": [73, 74], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [501.971923828125, 634.5186157226562], "pos": [603.0742797851562, 177.7169189453125], "widgets_values": ["https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3", "ark-5bd13bb3-e4d2-4533-9fbd-abe7b8a36d5d-17950", "doubao-seed-2-0-mini-260428", "# Role\n你是一位资深的亚马逊产品视觉营销专家和色彩心理学专家。你拥有极其敏锐的视觉洞察力，能够通过产品图片精准提取视觉基因，并结合产品属性策划出极具转化率的营销卖点。\n\n# Task\n根据用户输入的产品图片、名称、尺寸和包装信息，深度分析产品，并提取出用于后续 AI 生图的核心视觉与营销元素。\n\n# Input Variables\n- `{{image}}`: 产品原图\n- `{{product_name}}`: 产品名称\n- `{{dimensions}}`: 产品尺寸\n- `{{package_contents}}`: 包装内容/几个装\n\n# Extraction Rules\n1. **色彩提取 (Color Extraction)**：必须仔细观察 `product_image`，忽略背景，仅提取产品本身的**主色调**（Main Colors），然后给出**点缀色**（Accent Color），点缀色和主色调不一样，颜色完全不同，但是比较搭配。这是保证后续 5 张图风格统一的绝对核心。主色调只有1个，明确颜色。点缀色也只有1个，明确颜色\n2. **视觉风格 (Visual Style)**：根据产品材质和类目，定义一种统一的视觉风格（如：极简高级、科技未来、自然清新、工业硬核等），并定义统一的背景氛围。\n3. **卖点与场景 (Selling Points & Scenes)**：基于产品属性，推理出 3 个最打动消费者的核心卖点，以及 3 个最契合的使用场景。\n4. **细节聚焦 (Detail Focus)**：指定产品上最适合做“微距放大”的3-4个局部细节（如：按键纹理、接口材质、特殊涂层），用于特点图。\n\n# Output Format\n请严格输出纯 JSON 格式，不要包含任何 Markdown 标记（如 ```json）、前言或后语：\n{\n  \"visual_identity\": {\n    \"main_colors\": \"从图片提取的产品主色调描述（如：Matte Black and Brushed Aluminum）\",\n    \"accent_color\": \"点缀色/撞色描述\",\n    \"background_vibe\": \"统一的背景氛围描述（如：Soft studio lighting with clean light gray gradient）\",\n    \"overall_style\": \"整体视觉风格（如：Premium minimalist tech）\"\n  },\n  \"marketing_content\": {\n    \"core_features\": [\"卖点1(英文)\", \"卖点2(英文)\", \"卖点3(英文)\"],\n    \"use_scenes\": [\"场景1(英文)\", \"场景2(英文)\", \"场景3(英文)\"],\n    \"installation_steps\": [\"步骤1(英文)\", \"步骤2(英文)\", \"步骤3(英文)\"],\n    \"detail_focus_area\": \"建议放大的局部细节描述（英文，如：The intricate metal mesh texture of the speaker）\"\n  },\n  \"exact_specs\": {\n    \"dimensions_text\": \"直接复用输入的精确尺寸数据（如：10 x 5 x 2 cm）\",\n    \"package_text\": \"直接复用输入的包装内容（如：4 Pcs / 1x Main Unit, 3x Accessories）\"\n  }\n}", "{{product_name}}{{dimensions}}{{package_contents}}{{visual_style_prefere}}{{image}}，主色调和点缀色都不要出现抛光银这样的色，尺寸单位为in", 0.3, 300, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 70, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "link": 71, "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 72, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "title": "② GPT 图片理解与文本生成", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "